"pushes": {"100": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850983: Add check for correct format in DrawTarget::IntoLuminanceSource. r=jrmuizel a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187561", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTarget.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9ad762667d232ce58da82b4454d5aef347f2e33b", "parents": ["3dcf3dc332c56b560d17d6da5130dce9ae99ba05"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850180: Release assert on too many PopLayers in DrawTargetSkia and DrawTargetCairo. r=jrmuizel a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187470", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetCairo.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "915dfe9d51468816100a47b9c34d15ec593c11a0", "parents": ["9ad762667d232ce58da82b4454d5aef347f2e33b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1843962 - In WebrtcCallWrapper, reference conduits registered for ssrc changes. r=bwc a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186446", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/libwebrtcglue/WebrtcCallWrapper.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/libwebrtcglue/WebrtcCallWrapper.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1c0b3f98dddb6872dd9ccda4b93a9a457f11b0b9", "parents": ["915dfe9d51468816100a47b9c34d15ec593c11a0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1836353 - make mStartedReading an Atomic r=valentin,necko-reviewers a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187484", "files": ["netwerk/base/nsMIMEInputStream.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fbdf317c7df0b685115997236e3f11542bfcc78f", "parents": ["1c0b3f98dddb6872dd9ccda4b93a9a457f11b0b9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1694945209, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "101": {"changesets": [{"author": "sotaro \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1851432 - Add error handling to WebGLContext::PushRemoteTexture() r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman a=RyanVM\n\nSharedSurface_DMABUF::ToSurfaceDescriptor() could return Nothing() with error. It needs to be handled as failure.\n\nSharedSurface::ToSurfaceDescriptor() is expected to return Nothing() only with SharedSurface_Basic.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D188078", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLContext.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b8cdcdd7e5701f7b64734567a5d307efe0426a74", "parents": ["fbdf317c7df0b685115997236e3f11542bfcc78f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1694988992, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "102": {"changesets": [{"author": "Magnus Melin \u003cmkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850643 - Fix crash in [@ -[mozTableCellAccessible moxColumnHeaderUIElements]]. r=Jamie a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187763", "files": ["accessible/mac/mozTableAccessible.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "292b74333fbf1184c74dae65031b61380e64e1e1", "parents": ["b8cdcdd7e5701f7b64734567a5d307efe0426a74"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D188455", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2c8823a33b20be6e5f66cd4be685221ad1defff9", "parents": ["292b74333fbf1184c74dae65031b61380e64e1e1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1695038011, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "103": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842547 - ensure treecol label, crop and other attributes actually inherit correctly,  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D183207\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D188456", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/tree.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "17bedcda2f5c28b7fbc136d300bdbbf04f382e00", "parents": ["2c8823a33b20be6e5f66cd4be685221ad1defff9"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_115_3_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_115_3_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1695039054, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "76": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging bf2f656d025836975b7bf6aeb16901a037a01923 with FIREFOX_115_2_0esr_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b2d004b5b361686e0da1affe8aa9c887f1d80349", "parents": ["bf2f656d025836975b7bf6aeb16901a037a01923"], "tags": []}], "date": 1692626033, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "77": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Update configs. IGNORE BROKEN CHANGESETS CLOSED TREE NO BUG a=release ba=release", "files": ["CLOBBER", "browser/config/version.txt", "browser/config/version_display.txt", "config/milestone.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6a58ffb58ea554fd3a1c2276e5f9205a0e5c6bec", "parents": ["b2d004b5b361686e0da1affe8aa9c887f1d80349"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693233008, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld-merge"}, "78": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186929", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/gfx.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "02ed8155ab87653a464173e7565949f81e55766d", "parents": ["6a58ffb58ea554fd3a1c2276e5f9205a0e5c6bec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1749856 - Use GeneratedFile for rlbox.wasm.c. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,andi a=RyanVM\n\nThis moves the creation of both rlbox.wasm.c and rlbox.wasm.h to\npre-compile, which allows static-analysis to create both files (but more\nimportantly the .h) without also compiling rlbox.wasm.c, which takes\nforever.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D180173", "files": ["config/recurse.mk", "config/rules.mk", "config/wasm2c.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/backend/recursivemake.py", "security/rlbox/moz.build"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "24b06fb9d4c6f1fc76e3043eed9c182cf4f5cf20", "parents": ["02ed8155ab87653a464173e7565949f81e55766d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1848908 - Force the module name used with wasm2c. r=ahochheiden, a=RyanVM\n\nOn clang trunk, lld recently changed its behavior wrt linking wasm\nfiles, whereas it now always puts a module name in the output, while\nit didn't before. This leads wasm2c to use that module name in a way\nthat is not compatible with the rlbox code. Thus we force wasm2c to\nuse the module name it was defaulting to before.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186828", "files": ["config/wasm2c.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bdb7776ebcffb541db9d54b7ebdb05ce40bb4f83", "parents": ["24b06fb9d4c6f1fc76e3043eed9c182cf4f5cf20"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1848454: Ensure an attempt is made to terminate the child when SpawnTarget fails and there is no job. r=handyman, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186488", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium/sandbox/win/src/broker_services.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "36eb7766bb55653592e6685d67cd0801520f2089", "parents": ["bdb7776ebcffb541db9d54b7ebdb05ce40bb4f83"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693234248, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "79": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging bf2f656d025836975b7bf6aeb16901a037a01923 with FIREFOX_115_2_0esr_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b323e7d3c277db0fbd59c58f7418779f0c7d7cb7", "parents": ["36eb7766bb55653592e6685d67cd0801520f2089"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693313259, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "80": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tim Huang \u003ctihuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842030 - Part 1: Adding CanonicalBrowsingContext::IsPrivateBrowsingActive(). r=nika, a=dmeehan\n\nThe CanonicalBrowsingContext::IsPrivateBrowsingActive() function allows\nus to know if private browsing is active. We need it to prevent setting\ncookies if there is no active private browsing session.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D184010", "files": ["docshell/base/CanonicalBrowsingContext.cpp", "docshell/base/CanonicalBrowsingContext.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "155e00db2f45144e03fa0f71738a9a722d4969fe", "parents": ["b323e7d3c277db0fbd59c58f7418779f0c7d7cb7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim Huang \u003ctihuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842030 - Part 2: Check the global private browsing state for HttpBaseChannel::IsBrowsingContextDiscarded() if the loadGroup is not avaiable. r=necko-reviewers,jesup, a=dmeehan\n\nThe HttpBaseChannel::IsBrowsingContextDiscarded() did always return\nfalse if the loadGroup is not avaiable. But, this may not be correct for\nthe private channels if the private session has been ended. To fix this,\nwe make the function to check the global private browsing state\nif the loadGroup is not available for private channels.\n\nDepends on D184010\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D184479", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParent.cpp", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookiejars.js", "netwerk/test/unit_ipc/test_cookiejars_wrap.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a5e801062c134954611dbc795e3f8d691847ec62", "parents": ["155e00db2f45144e03fa0f71738a9a722d4969fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim Huang \u003ctihuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842030 - Part 3: Add a test to ensure a beacon response for a private session won't set cookie after private session ends. r=anti-tracking-reviewers,pbz, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D184012", "files": ["browser/components/privatebrowsing/test/browser/browser.ini", "browser/components/privatebrowsing/test/browser/browser_privatebrowsing_beacon.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9d8a85f62f6d58e1714e090532428cd162ec0ed4", "parents": ["a5e801062c134954611dbc795e3f8d691847ec62"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850525 - make esr115 not next-esr. r=releng-reviewers,gabriel, a=release\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187037", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/release-bouncer-aliases/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/release-update-verify-config/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "18ac3804a944c1c1ae382da45654d3a0e216fff9", "parents": ["9d8a85f62f6d58e1714e090532428cd162ec0ed4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update, r=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187187", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0a3b82e68edcd8bfc92c90398ba55d2875e61a2c", "parents": ["18ac3804a944c1c1ae382da45654d3a0e216fff9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693488487, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "81": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update r=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187377", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c70d9fb5aeddffbf530ff0915d6c99bf7fad6c65", "parents": ["0a3b82e68edcd8bfc92c90398ba55d2875e61a2c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693829276, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "82": {"changesets": [{"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1810360 - disable url/failure.html to avoid silent and future failures. r=aryx a=test-only DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D185736", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/url/failure.html.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cd548157ebca4b79b046aabef427abfe7f599f34", "parents": ["c70d9fb5aeddffbf530ff0915d6c99bf7fad6c65"], "tags": []}], "date": 1693852512, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "nfay@mozilla.com"}, "83": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1772409 - Allow setting xpinstall.whitelist.required via policy. r=settings-reviewers,Gijs a=pascalc", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.sys.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/privacy.js", "tools/lint/rejected-words.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "33954d3ed30c17457c50b58d0a937ea11b857c2f", "parents": ["cd548157ebca4b79b046aabef427abfe7f599f34"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1839442 - Add ssl negotiation pref to policy. r=keeler a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D185960", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d8aaeece13ce978b23cddf1297c0e938c3350030", "parents": ["33954d3ed30c17457c50b58d0a937ea11b857c2f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1844615 - Allow relay checkbox to be locked. r=sgalich,settings-reviewers,mconley a=pascalc", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/privacy.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/browser_privacy_relayIntegration.js", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/FirefoxRelay.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d1e53f81d245305da8147aa73a68ad9fb9f85e68", "parents": ["d8aaeece13ce978b23cddf1297c0e938c3350030"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1848615 - Adjust Linux content sandbox policy so that ICU can get the canonical time zone. r=gcp a=pascalc\n\nICU version 73 (bug 1824744) has [a change to call realpath][icu-2323]\nrather than just readlink on `/etc/localtime`, meaning that it needs to\nbe able to readlink every directory involved in path resolution.  In\nparticular, for a symlink into `/usr/share/zoneinfo`, this includes\n`/usr`, which is blocked by the content sandbox policy.\n\nCurrently, the file broker requires `MAY_READ` permission to allow\nreadlink, so we grant that on `/usr` and `/nix` (there will be a\nsimilar issue with symlinks to `/nix/store/...`).  Note that this\napplies only to those directories themselves, not files within them.\n\nThis also means that the process can open those directories for reading\n(i.e., readdir), but that should be relatively low-impact compared to\nthe information that's already exposed.\n\n[icu-2323]: https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/pull/2323\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186584", "files": ["security/sandbox/common/test/SandboxTestingChildTests.h", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerPolicyFactory.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d7948b142f437acb16055bca1181a5ae410ccecc", "parents": ["d1e53f81d245305da8147aa73a68ad9fb9f85e68"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1749535 - Add policy for Firefox Suggest. r=adw a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186241", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.sys.mjs", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.json", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser.ini", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_firefoxsuggest.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2369d61995ba9afa74b79121704e94213c9e4afb", "parents": ["d7948b142f437acb16055bca1181a5ae410ccecc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1851195 - Remove PContent::DeviceReset. r=gfx-reviewers,bradwerth a=pascalc\n\nThis IPC message is never used. about:support runs in the\nparent process, and test_device_reset.html is a mochitest chrome,\nso it also runs in the parent process.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187292", "files": ["dom/base/nsDOMWindowUtils.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/PContent.ipdl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4e7bf66ffc47cb1a8d89638b168d1606d07ce07d", "parents": ["2369d61995ba9afa74b79121704e94213c9e4afb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1694081860, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "84": {"changesets": [{"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850604 - Only expire variants on trunk. r=ahal,taskgraph-reviewers, a=dmeehan a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187054", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/conftest.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_transforms_test.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/test/variant.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "43879b908c89a10c96046c1d280815169795b070", "parents": ["4e7bf66ffc47cb1a8d89638b168d1606d07ce07d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Chevobbe \u003cnchevobbe@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842197 - [devtools] Only read devtools.inspector.ruleview.inline-compatibility-warning.enabled once. r=devtools-reviewers,ochameau, a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D183000", "files": ["devtools/client/inspector/rules/views/text-property-editor.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "34bfdf1883e0782185746057c98830e3b3addaab", "parents": ["43879b908c89a10c96046c1d280815169795b070"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Chevobbe \u003cnchevobbe@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1842197 - [devtools] Limit reads of devtools.inspector.ruleview.inline-compatibility-warning.enabled. r=devtools-reviewers,ochameau, a=pascalc\n\nWe already have a pref observer for the pref,\nso we can store the pref value on the RuleView\ninstance and check this property instead of\nusing Services.prefs.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D183001", "files": ["devtools/client/inspector/rules/rules.js", "devtools/client/inspector/rules/views/text-property-editor.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "290b18e49494e47512d8ef43250a77bea911b831", "parents": ["34bfdf1883e0782185746057c98830e3b3addaab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1851194 - adjust try_fuzzy.py to not have a variant as a choice. r=ahal a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187298", "files": ["tools/tryselect/test/test_fuzzy.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b1ae3d421ce31d0c909509ae767112fd8128cb8c", "parents": ["290b18e49494e47512d8ef43250a77bea911b831"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1850439 - Fix uses of snprintf. r=gsvelto a=pascalc\n\nThe buffers are sized for %nx, but what's actually used is %#nx, which\nadds a \"0x\" prefix, requiring 2 more characters.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D187006", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/breakpad-patches/22-winerror-codes.patch", "toolkit/crashreporter/breakpad-patches/24-macos-exc-resource.patch", "toolkit/crashreporter/google-breakpad/src/processor/minidump_processor.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ac8459950ca9718c72fedfe8004578628af1760a", "parents": ["b1ae3d421ce31d0c909509ae767112fd8128cb8c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1846683: Make assertions in FilterNodeD2D1::SetInput release ass