illa.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1580652 - Adjust runtime/chunks to avoid taskcluster timeouts. r=aryx, a=test-only DONTBUILD", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/test/mochitest.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "df0831f2168dfc00b24ba8ffee449ea75faa96c7", "parents": ["cbbf997c33890c2c49d24079db83b6ebb74cd7d8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1694882789, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "99": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kelly Cochrane \u003ckcochrane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1849723 - Fix text color for synced tabs sidebar with theme applied r=dao, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D186891", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/syncedtabs/sidebar.css"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2d71cff15d97179e41fd519450fb0ef7c011eb5f", "parents": ["df0831f2168dfc00b24ba8ffee449ea75faa96c7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brad Werth \u003cbwerth@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1852801: Allow WinWindowOcclusionTracker members to fail initialization without crashing. r=rkraesig,win-reviewers a=RyanVM\n\nThis patch also expands the use of EnsureDisplayStatusObserver and\nEnsureSessionChangeObserver, using them during the WinWindowOcclusionTracker\nconstructor, and also in WinWindowOcclusionTracker::Ensure. This gives another\nopportunity for these observers to be created when\nWinUtils::EnableWindowOcclusion is called.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D188039", "files": ["widget/windows/WinEventObserver.cpp", "widget/windows/WinEventObserver.h", "widget/windows/WinWindowOcclusionTracker.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3dcf3dc332c56b560d17d6da5130dce9ae99ba05", "parents": ["2d71cff15d97179e41fd519450fb0ef7c011eb5f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1694883472, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}}
